### Create new
POST {{url}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json
x-category-id: 1

{
  "name": "Merlot",
  "price": 12.5,
  "description": "A red wine",
  "picture": "merlot.png"
}

### Modify
PUT {{url}}/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Merlot",
  "price": 15.5,
  "description": "A red wine",
  "picture": "merlot.png"
}

### Get all
GET {{url}}/articles

### Get single
GET {{url}}/articles/1

### Delete
DELETE {{url}}/articles/1
